    "alttext": "\\ell_{k}(\\theta,\\omega)=\\frac{1}{N}\\sum_{i=1}^{N}-\\log(p(y_{i}^{k}|\\mathbf{x}_{i}^{k},t^{k};\\theta,\\omega))"
